{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u25bcSummary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a hand-drawn world, this 2.5D action RPG blends metroidvania exploration, RPG elements, and a sprawling overworld map. With dungeon hubs, narrative depth, and level-up mechanics, it offers freedom and classic adventure in a richly crafted fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/2X1_image_copy.jpg?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u25bcStory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The land of Speria is shrouded in darkness, with monsters ravaging villages. Survivors gather at Crescent Isle\u2019s monastery, seeking hope from the Moonken Monks. Raziel Tenza, a Twilight Monk descendant, must stop the traitor Nox and restore peace, as internal conflicts threaten even the monks\u2019 unity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/a_EN.jpg?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25bcMain Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfy your desire for adventure as you dive into intricate dungeons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon holds secrets and areas you can't access initially. Gaining new skills unlocks hidden treasures, scrolls, secret passages, and puzzles, adding depth to your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/b.gif?t=1745817854\" /></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the nostalgia of classic JRPGs through the overworld map and towns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While traversing the overhead world map connecting the dungeons, you'll frequently encounter enemy monsters. When a battle breaks out, you'll be teleported to a battle arena tailored to the surrounding terrain, offering combat experiences similar to those found during dungeon exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/c.gif?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Be sure to explore every nook and cranny of the towns scattered across the world map to fully immerse yourself in the classic JRPG experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/g.gif?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the wielder of the 'Phantom Pillar.\u2019</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mysterious artifact infused with ancient power, can be used for platforming, battle, blocking enemy attacks, or even to activate mechanisms and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/d.gif?t=1745817854\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/e.gif?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/f.gif?t=1745817854\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An original world brought to life through hand-drawn 2D illustrations.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a hand-drawn world, this 2.5D action RPG blends metroidvania exploration, RPG elements, and a sprawling overworld map. With dungeon hubs, narrative depth, and level-up mechanics, it offers freedom and classic adventure in a richly crafted fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/\u30c0\u30f3\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3.png?t=1745817854\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911940/extras/\u30c0\u30f3\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\uff12__1_.png?t=1745817854\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reach level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/4b44d8b88f2a01ccf7eef31f0833694a26a85bbf.jpg"},{"name":"Reach level 25","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/6e048cca5f94013d4dbd445c36049e51f661366f.jpg"},{"name":"Reach level 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/2080dd7a190e9d0316d34d411274c8b569dd90c7.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 10 Monster Hunts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/c5826055416b72ae1d78c1028619a55e24b98194.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 20 Monster Hunts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/15b4172a61ffeb2adecffb0ac0a359acd3ce4108.jpg"},{"name":" Complete 40 Monster Hunts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/b42968df61e4002e20061b3db8683ac5d206bec5.jpg"},{"name":" Complete 60 Monster Hunts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/edb39376de6c3cbe6550a421aa0f00923c03e777.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 86 Monster Hunts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/23747bc6f5412edb3b3731c16b4edd9e78b71313.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Vashti","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/4136f2b680eff298c37b8dd4f56274d11aad0f84.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Razor Feng","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911940/d17ee9a22c31c9cff02ff5b80b2bc618b9db087f.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911940?t=1745817854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.s